// APNT shielded pool v1: the pending-batch lock (task 3.3).
//
// Target: protocol-design, "Note tree,
// root copies and the tree update": "The pending lock allows spending only as
// input 1 of a tree-update transaction." Layout historical-record F1: the lock commits
// the batch's leaf list (historical-record, historical-record's measured revision; historical-record).
//
// Maturity: new. Deterministic local-VM evidence only
// (packages/reference-aggregator/test/apnt_pool_tree_covenants_v1_local_vm.test.ts).
// Not deployed, not frozen, not a chain claim.
//
// A settlement moves its verdict token (verdict category, no capability,
// commitment SHA-256(S)) to output 0 under this lock, with the fold bounty
// (task 3.4, check 6). The redeem is
//
//   <H_cm> OP_DROP ‖ PCODE,  H_cm = SHA-256(cm_{1,0} ‖ cm_{1,1} ‖ … ‖ cm_{B,1})
//
// the batch's leaves in statement order, which the settlement computes from
// its own S. So each settled batch has its own pending lock, and the fold
// (the tree-update covenant) reads H_cm from this redeem and pushes the 64·B
// bytes of leaves instead of S. PCODE, the code below the data push, admits a
// spend only:
//
//   position    as input 1;
//   fold        beside input 0 carrying the root category T's minting NFT,
//               which only the tree update holds (audited genesis, then the
//               tree-update covenant recreating it under its own lock).
//
// The tree-update covenant then folds the leaves and burns the token. So a
// pending verdict can be neither spent without its fold nor burned in a fold
// of another batch: burning it unfolded would leave the batch's notes out of
// the tree for good.
//
// The lock names T, not the tree-update lock: the tree-update covenant embeds
// this redeem's layout, so this lock cannot embed it. The settlement and the
// tree update read the layout <H_cm> OP_DROP ‖ PCODE from this source's
// compiled bytes (apnt_pool_tree_covenants_v1.ts), so they cannot drift apart.
//
// Unlocking data: the P2SH32 redeem push only.
//
// Local VM acceptance is not chain validation, proof verification, wallet
// acceptance or spendability.

@LEAF_LIST_DIGEST_PUSH@ OP_DROP
//@check PENDING_INDEX
OP_INPUTINDEX <1> OP_NUMEQUALVERIFY
//@end
//@check FOLD_AT_INPUT_0
<0> OP_UTXOTOKENCATEGORY @ROOT_CATEGORY_MINTING_PUSH@ OP_EQUALVERIFY
//@end
<1>
